# CLAUDE.md is committed in this repo, overriding the global ignore: it carries the project
# capability table that skills branch on, and a declaration only present on one machine reads as
# "not enabled" everywhere else — a silent skipped check. Personal, uncommitted instructions go in
# CLAUDE.local.md instead.
!CLAUDE.md
